{
    "name": "@devanthos/plugin-mercadopago",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Plugin de integración completa con Mercado Pago para pagos en Latinoamérica",
    "author": "Devanthos",
    "license": "MIT",
    "frameworks": ["next"],
    "dependencies": {
        "next": {
            "mercadopago": "^2.0.0"
        }
    },
    "devDependencies": {},
    "envVars": ["MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN", "NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL", "MERCADOPAGO_PUBLIC_KEY"],
    "files": [
        {
            "framework": "next",
            "source": "src/lib/mercadopago.ts",
            "destination": "lib/mercadopago.ts"
        },
        {
            "framework": "next",
            "source": "src/app/api/mercadopago/checkout/route.ts",
            "destination": "app/api/mercadopago/checkout/route.ts"
        },
        {
            "framework": "next",
            "source": "src/app/api/mercadopago/webhook/route.ts",
            "destination": "app/api/mercadopago/webhook/route.ts"
        },
        {
            "framework": "next",
            "source": "src/components/CheckoutButton.tsx",
            "destination": "components/mercadopago/CheckoutButton.tsx"
        },
        {
            "framework": "next",
            "source": "src/components/ProductCard.tsx",
            "destination": "components/mercadopago/ProductCard.tsx"
        }
    ],
    "postInstall": {
        "message": "💳 Mercado Pago configurado exitosamente.",
        "instructions": [
            "1. Crea una cuenta en Mercado Pago Developers: https://www.mercadopago.com.ar/developers",
            "2. Crea una aplicación y obtén tus credenciales",
            "3. Configura las variables de entorno en .env:",
            "   MERCADOPAGO_ACCESS_TOKEN=tu_access_token_aqui",
            "   NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000",
            "   MERCADOPAGO_PUBLIC_KEY=tu_public_key_aqui",
            "",
            "4. Para testing usa credenciales de prueba (Test credentials)",
            "5. Configura el webhook en tu aplicación de Mercado Pago:",
            "   URL: https://tu-dominio.com/api/mercadopago/webhook",
            "",
            "6. Uso básico:",
            "   import { CheckoutButton } from '@/components/mercadopago/CheckoutButton';",
            "   ",
            "   <CheckoutButton",
            "     items={[{",
            "       title: 'Producto',",
            "       quantity: 1,",
            "       unit_price: 1000",
            "     }]}",
            "   />",
            "",
            "7. Docs: https://www.mercadopago.com.ar/developers/es/docs"
        ]
    },
    "features": [
        "Checkout completo con Mercado Pago",
        "Webhook para notificaciones IPN",
        "Soporte para múltiples métodos de pago",
        "Componentes React listos para usar",
        "TypeScript completamente tipado",
        "Manejo de estados de pago",
        "Soporte para testing con credenciales de prueba",
        "Compatible con todos los países de Latinoamérica"
    ],
    "countries": [
        "Argentina",
        "Brasil",
        "Chile",
        "Colombia",
        "México",
        "Perú",
        "Uruguay",
        "Venezuela"
    ]
}
